Add optional tag names in mango config via tag_rule=id:N,name:X, falling back
to the numbered defaults, and a 'rename tag <index> <name>' IPC command.
Tag names are exposed in mmsg tag JSON ("name") and as ext-workspace-v1 names.
Port of https://github.com/mangowm/mango/pull/1092 to the split config source
layout (tested against 5040bc34).

